This project includes research reference material from the openai/math
repository, commit fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb, under Apache-2.0.

The Python implementation is a new translation of the mathematical
construction; the storage formats, tests, and benchmarks are new code.
It has not been formally verified and is not an upstream OpenAI release.

Source links and stored-file hashes are recorded in references/sources.json.
